{"task_id": "Mbpp/120", "solution": "def max_product_tuple(tuple_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Find the maximum absolute product between numbers in pairs of tuples.\n    Assumes valid input as per type hints, without explicit error checks for edge cases.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_abs_product = abs(tuple_list[0][0] * tuple_list[0][1])\n\n    for i in range(1, len(tuple_list)):\n        a, b = tuple_list[i]\n        current_product = abs(a * b)\n        if current_product > max_abs_product:\n            max_abs_product = current_product\n\n    return max_abs_product"}
