{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "def difference(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the difference between the sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers\n    and the sum of the first n natural numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    # The sum of the first n natural numbers is n * (n + 1) / 2\n    sum_of_numbers_val = n * (n + 1) // 2\n    \n    # The sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers is (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2\n    sum_of_cubes_val = sum_of_numbers_val ** 2\n    \n    return sum_of_cubes_val - sum_of_numbers_val"}
