{"task_id": "Mbpp/633", "solution": "def pair_xor_Sum(numbers, count):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of XOR of all unique pairs of numbers in the given list.\n    The 'count' parameter is unused as list length is implicitly available.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_xor_sum = 0\n    n = len(numbers)\n    # Iterate through all unique pairs of numbers (i, j) where i < j\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            total_xor_sum += (numbers[i] ^ numbers[j])\n    return total_xor_sum"}
