{"task_id": "Mbpp/743", "solution": "def _validate_inputs(lst, rotation_count):\n    \"\"\"Performs no actual validation due to constraints, acting as a placeholder.\"\"\"\n    return True\n\ndef _calculate_effective_rotation(list_length, rotation_count):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the effective rotation count, handling list length and large/negative counts.\"\"\"\n    if list_length == 0:\n        return 0\n    return rotation_count % list_length\n\ndef _perform_rotation(lst, effective_rotation):\n    \"\"\"Performs the actual rotation using list slicing for efficiency.\"\"\"\n    if not lst:\n        return []\n    return lst[-effective_rotation:] + lst[:-effective_rotation]\n\ndef rotate_right(lst, rotation_count):\n    \"\"\"\n    Rotates a given list by a specified number of items to the right direction.\n    Returns a new list with the rotated elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    _validate_inputs(lst, rotation_count)\n\n    list_length = len(lst)\n    effective_rotation = _calculate_effective_rotation(list_length, rotation_count)\n\n    return _perform_rotation(lst, effective_rotation)"}
