{"task_id": "Mbpp/797", "solution": "def sum_in_range(l: int, r: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculate sum of odd natural numbers within inclusive range [l, r].\n    \"\"\"\n    current_sum = 0\n    # Ensure l is the smaller number for iteration\n    start = min(l, r)\n    end = max(l, r)\n\n    # If the start number is even, increment to the next odd number\n    if start % 2 == 0:\n        start += 1\n    \n    # Iterate through odd numbers and add them to the sum\n    for num in range(start, end + 1, 2):\n        current_sum += num\n        \n    return current_sum"}
